<title>FRANCE: French housing starts up 5 pct in 3-mos to end May.</title>
<headline>French housing starts up 5 pct in 3-mos to end May.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French housing ministry gave the following unadjusted figures on housing starts in three months to end May 1997.</p>
<p>			     3-mos to end     12-mos to end</p>
<p>				 May 1997	     May 1997</p>
<p>HOUSING APPROVED</p>
<p> (total nos)		  71,000	  298,900</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -4.1	     -1.9</p>
<p> STARTED			71,100	  271,700</p>
<p> (percent)			 5.0	     -2.6</p>
<p>NON-HOUSE BUILDING</p>
<p>APPROVED</p>
<p> (sq metres)		   7,832	   32,279</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -2.7	     -5.5</p>
<p> STARTED			 6,625	   29,423</p>
<p> percent			 -11.2	     -7.2</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
